# A signature with R equal to the identity element and S = k*s. RFC 8032 5.2.3
# decodes the identity like any other point and the verification equation
# [S]B = R + [k]A holds, so this must be accepted. Only the holder of the
# private key can produce it (it corresponds to the nonce r being zero mod L).
PublicKey = 419610a534af127f583b04818cdb7f0ff300b025f2e01682bcae33fd691cee039511df0cddc690ee978426e8b38e50ce5af7dcfba50f704c00
